source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: The first `}}` is still the closer candidate even when a single backslash precedes it, and the following word rune refuses the span, so both Jira and jiro keep the whole run literal.
-- input.jira --
{{a\}}b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p>{{a}}b}}</p>
-- want.md --
{{a}}b}}
-- warnings.json --
[]
